{"seq":2,"slug":"secure-aggregation","title":"安全聚合与 MPC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/federated-privacy-ml/privacy/secure-aggregation","wordCount":1437,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"安全聚合与-mpc\">安全聚合与 MPC</h1><p><a href=\"differential-privacy\">差分隐私</a> 保护的是最终结果，但它有个尴尬的留白：在标准实现里，服务器依然能看到每个客户端单独上传的更新——加噪发生在聚合处。可单个梯度更新本身就足以反演出训练样本。安全聚合（Secure Aggregation, SecAgg）补上这个洞：它用密码学让服务器<strong>只能解出所有更新的总和，看不到任何一个单独的更新</strong>。这一篇讲清 SecAgg 的成对掩码机制、它如何容忍客户端掉线、以及它在多方安全计算（MPC）谱系里的位置。本 hub 提到「服务器只见总和」的地方，机制都在这里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>安全聚合属于多方安全计算（Secure Multi-Party Computation, MPC）的一个特例——多方各持私有输入，协作算出一个公共函数（这里是求和），过程中谁也不暴露自己的输入。它要对抗的威胁是「诚实但好奇」（honest-but-curious）的服务器：服务器会老老实实执行协议，但会试图从收到的消息里偷看个体信息。</p>\n<p>Bonawitz 等人在 2017 年提出的经典 SecAgg 协议，核心是<strong>成对随机掩码</strong>：每两个客户端 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i, j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 通过密钥协商生成一个共享的随机掩码 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{i,j}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，约定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 在自己的更新上加它、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 减它。每个客户端上传的是被掩码遮住的更新，单看任何一个都是一团随机噪声；可当服务器把所有客户端的上传相加时，所有成对掩码两两抵消，干净的总和浮现出来。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>w</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_k \\tilde{w}_k = \\sum_k \\left( w_k + \\sum_{j&gt;k} s_{k,j} - \\sum_{j&lt;k} s_{j,k} \\right) = \\sum_k w_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.6em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.6em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.875em;height:3.6em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.875em\" height=\"3.6em\" viewBox=\"0 0 875 3600\"><path d=\"M863,9c0,-2,-2,-5,-6,-9c0,0,-17,0,-17,0c-12.7,0,-19.3,0.3,-20,1\nc-5.3,5.3,-10.3,11,-15,17c-242.7,294.7,-395.3,682,-458,1162c-21.3,163.3,-33.3,349,\n-36,557 l0,84c0.2,6,0,26,0,60c2,159.3,10,310.7,24,454c53.3,528,210,\n949.7,470,1265c4.7,6,9.7,11.7,15,17c0.7,0.7,7,1,19,1c0,0,18,0,18,0c4,-4,6,-7,6,-9\nc0,-2.7,-3.3,-8.7,-10,-18c-135.3,-192.7,-235.5,-414.3,-300.5,-665c-65,-250.7,-102.5,\n-544.7,-112.5,-882c-2,-104,-3,-167,-3,-189\nl0,-92c0,-162.7,5.7,-314,17,-454c20.7,-272,63.7,-513,129,-723c65.3,\n-210,155.3,-396.3,270,-559c6.7,-9.3,10,-15.3,10,-18z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4382em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4382em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.6em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.875em;height:3.6em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.875em\" height=\"3.6em\" viewBox=\"0 0 875 3600\"><path d=\"M76,0c-16.7,0,-25,3,-25,9c0,2,2,6.3,6,13c21.3,28.7,42.3,60.3,\n63,95c96.7,156.7,172.8,332.5,228.5,527.5c55.7,195,92.8,416.5,111.5,664.5\nc11.3,139.3,17,290.7,17,454c0,28,1.7,43,3.3,45l0,9\nc-3,4,-3.3,16.7,-3.3,38c0,162,-5.7,313.7,-17,455c-18.7,248,-55.8,469.3,-111.5,664\nc-55.7,194.7,-131.8,370.3,-228.5,527c-20.7,34.7,-41.7,66.3,-63,95c-2,3.3,-4,7,-6,11\nc0,7.3,5.7,11,17,11c0,0,11,0,11,0c9.3,0,14.3,-0.3,15,-1c5.3,-5.3,10.3,-11,15,-17\nc242.7,-294.7,395.3,-681.7,458,-1161c21.3,-164.7,33.3,-350.7,36,-558\nl0,-144c-2,-159.3,-10,-310.7,-24,-454c-53.3,-528,-210,-949.7,\n-470,-1265c-4.7,-6,-9.7,-11.7,-15,-17c-0.7,-0.7,-6.7,-1,-18,-1z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>下表把安全聚合放进隐私技术的坐标系，和差分隐私、同态加密对照。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>保护对象</th>\n<th>服务器能看到</th>\n<th>主要代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>差分隐私</td>\n<td>聚合结果（防个体推断）</td>\n<td>单个更新（加噪后）</td>\n<td>精度损失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全聚合</td>\n<td>聚合过程（防偷看个体）</td>\n<td>仅总和</td>\n<td>通信/握手开销、掉线处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"homomorphic-encryption\">同态加密</a></td>\n<td>密文上的计算</td>\n<td>仅密文</td>\n<td>沉重计算开销</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"成对掩码-让单个更新变噪声-让总和变干净\">成对掩码：让单个更新变噪声、让总和变干净</h2><p>理解 SecAgg 的关键是看掩码如何「成对抵消」。下图展示三个客户端的成对掩码：每条边代表一对共享掩码，一端加、一端减，求和时全部归零。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[客户端A&lt;br/&gt;上传 w_A + s_AB + s_AC] --&gt;|相加| SUM[服务器求和]&#10;  B[客户端B&lt;br/&gt;上传 w_B - s_AB + s_BC] --&gt;|相加| SUM&#10;  C[客户端C&lt;br/&gt;上传 w_C - s_AC - s_BC] --&gt;|相加| SUM&#10;  SUM --&gt;|成对掩码两两抵消| RESULT[得到 w_A + w_B + w_C&lt;br/&gt;看不到任何单个 w]\">flowchart TD\n  A[客户端A&lt;br/&gt;上传 w_A + s_AB + s_AC] --&gt;|相加| SUM[服务器求和]\n  B[客户端B&lt;br/&gt;上传 w_B - s_AB + s_BC] --&gt;|相加| SUM\n  C[客户端C&lt;br/&gt;上传 w_C - s_AC - s_BC] --&gt;|相加| SUM\n  SUM --&gt;|成对掩码两两抵消| RESULT[得到 w_A + w_B + w_C&lt;br/&gt;看不到任何单个 w]</pre><p>掩码本身怎么来？每对客户端用 Diffie-Hellman 密钥协商商定一个共享种子，再用伪随机生成器把种子展开成和模型同样大小的掩码向量。这样真正要传输和存储的只是种子，不是整个掩码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"掉线难题与-shamir-秘密共享\">掉线难题与 Shamir 秘密共享</h2><p>成对掩码有个致命弱点：如果客户端 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 中途掉线，它和别人约定的掩码 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{i,j}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 就<strong>没有对应的「减项」来抵消</strong>，残留在总和里把结果污染成垃圾。而 <a href=\"../foundations/fl-paradigm\">联邦学习范式</a> 早就强调，跨设备场景里大面积掉线是常态而非例外。SecAgg 必须能容忍掉线。</p>\n<p>Bonawitz 的解法是 <strong>Shamir 秘密共享</strong>：每个客户端把自己掩码种子的「碎片」分发给其他客户端，任意 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 个碎片能重建出原种子、少于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 个则一无所知。聚合时若某客户端掉线，服务器向存活的客户端收集足够碎片、重建出掉线者的掩码、把它从总和里减掉，结果就恢复干净。这套机制在「容忍掉线」和「不泄露在线者隐私」之间走钢丝——只重建掉线者的掩码、绝不重建在线者的。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# SecAgg 概念流程（极简示意）&#10;def secagg_round(clients):&#10;    # 1. 成对密钥协商，生成共享种子&#10;    seeds = pairwise_key_agreement(clients)&#10;    # 2. 每个种子做 Shamir 秘密共享，碎片分发给其他客户端&#10;    shares = {c: shamir_split(seeds[c], threshold=t) for c in clients}&#10;    # 3. 客户端上传被成对掩码遮住的更新&#10;    masked = {c: c.update + pairwise_mask(seeds, c) for c in clients}&#10;    # 4. 处理掉线：用碎片重建掉线者掩码并扣除&#10;    dropped = detect_dropouts(clients)&#10;    recovered = reconstruct_masks(shares, dropped)&#10;    return sum(masked.values()) - recovered\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># SecAgg 概念流程（极简示意）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> secagg_round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(clients):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 1. 成对密钥协商，生成共享种子</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    seeds </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pairwise_key_agreement(clients)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 2. 每个种子做 Shamir 秘密共享，碎片分发给其他客户端</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    shares </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {c: shamir_split(seeds[c], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">threshold</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">t) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> clients}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 3. 客户端上传被成对掩码遮住的更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    masked </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {c: c.update </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pairwise_mask(seeds, c) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> clients}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 4. 处理掉线：用碎片重建掉线者掩码并扣除</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dropped </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> detect_dropouts(clients)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    recovered </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reconstruct_masks(shares, dropped)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(masked.values()) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recovered</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"单服务器-vs-多服务器-以及与-dp-的组合\">单服务器 vs 多服务器，以及与 DP 的组合</h2><p>经典 SecAgg 是单服务器协议，但成对掩码的通信和握手开销随客户端数平方增长，超大规模下吃力。后续工作（如 SecAgg+、基于种子同态 PRG 的方案）把复杂度降到近线性。2024 年以来还出现了用「无状态安全聚合」「一轮非交互聚合」等思路进一步压缩交互轮次的协议，以适配 IoT 等弱设备场景（来源：eprint.iacr.org/2024/1655）。</p>\n<p>另一条路是引入两个不串通的服务器，把求和拆给两方算——这更接近通用 MPC 的两方/多方加性秘密共享框架，工程上更简单，但需要「两服务器不合谋」这条额外信任假设。</p>\n<p>最关键的一点：安全聚合和 <a href=\"differential-privacy\">差分隐私</a> 不是二选一，而是黄金搭档。SecAgg 让服务器只见总和，DP 让总和本身也带噪、防止从总和反推个体——二者叠加得到「分布式差分隐私」，既不让服务器偷看单个更新、又对最终结果给可证明保证。这套组合正是工业级隐私方案的主流形态，在 <a href=\"../applications/real-world-deployments\">真实部署与合规</a> 里会看到它的落地。至于它到底防住了哪些攻击，对照 <a href=\"../applications/threat-models\">威胁模型与攻击</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>安全聚合是 MPC 的特例，目标是让诚实但好奇的服务器只能解出更新总和、看不到单个更新。</li>\n<li>经典 SecAgg 用成对随机掩码：单个更新被遮成噪声，求和时掩码两两抵消露出干净总和。</li>\n<li>客户端掉线会留下未抵消的掩码，用 Shamir 秘密共享重建掉线者掩码并扣除来容错。</li>\n<li>成对掩码开销随客户端数平方增长，新协议用近线性、非交互、双服务器等方式优化。</li>\n<li>SecAgg 与差分隐私互补叠加为「分布式 DP」，是工业级隐私方案的主流组合。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"安全聚合与 MPC","id":"安全聚合与-mpc"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"成对掩码：让单个更新变噪声、让总和变干净","id":"成对掩码-让单个更新变噪声-让总和变干净"},{"level":2,"text":"掉线难题与 Shamir 秘密共享","id":"掉线难题与-shamir-秘密共享"},{"level":2,"text":"单服务器 vs 多服务器，以及与 DP 的组合","id":"单服务器-vs-多服务器-以及与-dp-的组合"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"差分隐私","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/federated-privacy-ml/privacy/differential-privacy"},"next":{"title":"同态加密","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/federated-privacy-ml/privacy/homomorphic-encryption"}}